### Gestor Películas API - Colección de endpoints
### Compatible con VS Code REST Client extension y JetBrains HTTP Client

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json

# Primero haz login y copia el access_token aquí:
@token = TU_ACCESS_TOKEN_AQUI
@refreshToken = TU_REFRESH_TOKEN_AQUI

# ======================================================================
# HEALTH CHECK
# ======================================================================

### API Root
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

# ======================================================================
# AUTH
# ======================================================================

### Registro
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Juan García",
  "email": "juan@example.com",
  "password": "mipassword123"
}

###

### Login (usuario demo del seeder)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Refresh token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

###

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

# ======================================================================
# BÚSQUEDA
# ======================================================================

### Buscar película
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?query=inception&type=movie&page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Buscar serie
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?query=breaking+bad&type=tv
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Detalle de película (Inception - TMDB ID: 27205)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/media/27205?type=movie
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Detalle de serie (Breaking Bad - TMDB ID: 1396)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/media/1396?type=tv
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# ======================================================================
# CATÁLOGO LOCAL
# ======================================================================

### Catálogo paginado
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/catalog?page=1&per_page=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Títulos populares
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/catalog/popular
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# ======================================================================
# LISTAS DE USUARIO
# ======================================================================

### Ver mis listas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/lists
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Crear lista
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/lists
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Sci-Fi favoritas",
  "description": "Las mejores películas de ciencia ficción",
  "is_public": true
}

###

### Ver detalle de lista (con items)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/lists/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Actualizar lista
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/lists/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Sci-Fi - Top",
  "is_public": false
}

###

### Eliminar lista
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/lists/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# ======================================================================
# ITEMS DE LISTA
# ======================================================================

### Añadir película a lista (Inception)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/lists/1/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "tmdb_id": 27205,
  "media_type": "movie"
}

###

### Añadir serie a lista (Breaking Bad)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/lists/1/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "tmdb_id": 1396,
  "media_type": "tv"
}

###

### Actualizar item (marcar visto + nota + puntuación)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/lists/1/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "watched": true,
  "user_rating": 9.5,
  "user_note": "Obra maestra absoluta. El final es perfecto."
}

###

### Quitar item de lista
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/lists/1/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# ======================================================================
# PERFIL DE USUARIO
# ======================================================================

### Ver mi perfil
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Actualizar perfil
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/user/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Juan García López",
  "avatar_url": "https://example.com/avatar.jpg"
}

###

### Cambiar contraseña
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/user/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "current_password": "password123",
  "new_password": "nuevapassword456"
}
